+# archive-fetcher
+
+Downloads the document archive of the partner portals.
+
+```
+archive-fetch urls.txt --dest archive --workers 4
+```
+
+- Each URL downloads once, also when the list names it twice.
+- Only PDF and ZIP files are kept. Other content types are skipped with a warning.
+- The exit code is 1 when a download failed.
